{"4664840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In the Van", "steam_appid": 4664840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Add In the Van to your wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/e88a41adf9d0167cf3eabbb56ff9a7ac.avif?t=1788102635\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with love by a 2-person indie team! Add In the Van to your wishlist if you'd like to support us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Discord is now open! 👾 Come join us, share your ideas, and help us build this cozy apocalypse together.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your cozy apocalypse begins in a van.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your survivor and face a world overrun by zombies, with your van as your only home. <br>Scavenge, fight, craft, cook, farm, and build a life of your own. <br>Decode abandoned devices to find a way out. The apocalypse may not have been an accident. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚙 Upgrade your mobile base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your storage, install upgrades, and turn your van into a true survival shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/af4d2c0ac377e21bb07050f93c88f2b7.poster.avif?t=1788102635\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/af4d2c0ac377e21bb07050f93c88f2b7.webm?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/af4d2c0ac377e21bb07050f93c88f2b7.mp4?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚙 Find your survival routine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, scavenge, craft, cook, clean, and prepare for the next journey, all at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/7835029136f8486bbd327caeb25a14cd.poster.avif?t=1788102635\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/7835029136f8486bbd327caeb25a14cd.webm?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/7835029136f8486bbd327caeb25a14cd.mp4?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚙 Make it cozy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a harsh world, survival isn't just staying alive. It's making life feel livable <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/2d3474a40247953843412f9a26601dfb.poster.avif?t=1788102635\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/2d3474a40247953843412f9a26601dfb.webm?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/2d3474a40247953843412f9a26601dfb.mp4?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/62a27269b6a97bdade08521ac1a4eeb3.poster.avif?t=1788102635\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/62a27269b6a97bdade08521ac1a4eeb3.webm?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/62a27269b6a97bdade08521ac1a4eeb3.mp4?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚙 Investigate what the dead left behind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover digital devices left behind by the dead to uncover clues and hidden locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/3cb3cf278863991af966c9b839042da7.poster.avif?t=1788102635\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/3cb3cf278863991af966c9b839042da7.webm?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/3cb3cf278863991af966c9b839042da7.mp4?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚙 Scavenge &amp; Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the ruins for food, fuel, and materials, then craft what you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/98fa5eb9c5f9aabb4d58a17bed719a48.poster.avif?t=1788102635\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664840/extras/98fa5eb9c5f9aabb4d58a17bed719a48.webm?t=1788102635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a